      "message": "Could be do {} while (failure \u0026\u0026 retries_remaining--);\n\nDo you think it would be better to put the body in a function? \n\nI had imagined that we would put the retry in the i2c host function, so that we retry on all accesses (e.g. battery), not just pmu. But your change is better I think - since it is safer and more limited in scope.",
